  "id": "builtin-ni-x1-ssl22-v1",
  "name": "Traktor Kontrol X1 MK1 (SSL 2.2 template)",
  "manufacturer": "Native Instruments",
  "notes": "Original X1 MK1 only. Requires Controller Editor 2.8.2's unmodified Serato Scratch Live 2.2 template, Basic page, and MIDI mode (Shift + Hotcue). Independent mixless assignments: dry/wet knobs control FX mix, P1–P3 control EQ, Cue buttons control PFL, Play/Sync control transport, upper pushes load, lower pushes loop, beat buttons jump. Both browse wheels send the same address. Loop-size wheels, Shift page, temporary cue, lights and display are unmapped. Hardware unverified.",
  "provenance": [
    {
      "url": "https://support.native-instruments.com/support/solutions/articles/69000882238-native-instruments-drivers-other-files",
      "revision": "Controller Editor 2.8.2",
      "section": "Templates/Serato Scratch Live 2.2.nckx1; Basic page; see NI_COMPATIBILITY.md for source fingerprints"
    }
